  message: "Fixed in PR #3885. Renamed 'Test-Dense' header to 'Most-Called from Tests', relabeled t/LOC→edges/LOC and N tests→N test-call edges, dropped 'redundant tests' phrasing, added clarifying footnote. Regression test asserts header does NOT contain 'redundant tests' and DOES contain 'Most-Called from Tests'."  # d2b0
